# --- GitHub Actions ------------------------------------------------------------
# The App used by this workspace lacks the `workflows` permission, so a push
# touching .github/workflows/ is rejected outright. The real workflow is kept at
# ci/github-actions-ci.yml; see ci/README.md for the one-command activation.
.github/workflows/
